omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yOmNws_tNLkQ7kNvwFcJ3gs&_nc_oc=AdpyHP1odvOUJQ_6zj5EbMQXRhmHDgNCvu_hW14BQ6A5K-tK5eYEN_DUq6uK5uI7IcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1yVQc1xFWpIGRXmqAQeUve1euzaNw3C2Uf3GPTon0yaQ&oe=69E75DF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6L_HR1-J1fAQ7kNvwHRBL5o&_nc_oc=Adpw1GB0Smb60Q-HPFPDyN-aQpMjntCVrtzbTsVH416Vz2LyxzwoO5VpROdfozRy_Jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1B7A_zSKlc-InqLjaglN0fcOhza4pQcqzZMrNDyXMKJg&oe=69E75F56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y8oTgDErqbYQ7kNvwFmOdn8&_nc_oc=AdpvtvhgiyDKGrPAYosOk_CKu8PWYCngu8u0wHshqK77A8d68KTQY8JfenYHIhz_1vc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1K3ktUyE62yO_B7k0fsaCrDiQOv8hynxgtFbp_DGyFfg&oe=69E77477"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://